  <tag code="3.4" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3.4 - By 2030, reduce by one third premature mortality from non-communicable diseases through prevention and treatment and promote mental health and well-being.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3.4 - Till 2030 genom f&#xf6;rebyggande insatser och behandling minska det antal m&#xe4;nniskor som d&#xf6;r i f&#xf6;rtid av icke smittsamma sjukdomar med en tredjedel samt fr&#xe4;mja psykisk h&#xe4;lsa och v&#xe4;lbefinnande.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="3.9" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3.9 - By 2030, substantially reduce the number of deaths and illnesses from hazardous chemicals and air, water and soil pollution and contamination.</narrative>
